    {
      "Id": 100600290,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Teach me again next time, Sensei!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600300,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "See you later!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600310,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600320,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei, I heard!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600330,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Your hot water isn't working?! Does that mean you have to take a cold shower?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600340,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Ugh. Yeah, it's the worst!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600350,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I do, but it's not a big deal."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600360,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600370,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "No, Sensei! Hot water is very important!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600380,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "You can't take a cold shower on a chilly day like this! You'll get sick!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600390,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "That makes a lot of sense..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600400,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Sometimes, patience is a virtue."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600410,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Hmm!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600420,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I have no choice but to take action!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600430,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600440,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "...Megu?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600450,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Wow! That was fun!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600460,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I really enjoyed Morimori!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600470,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Me too, Megu."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600480,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Let me know anytime you want some."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600490,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600500,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Let's go to the hot springs together next time."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600510,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Heeheehee!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600520,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600530,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Do you like ramen?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600540,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Like the kind you cook in a pot."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600550,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Of course, why?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600560,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I eat it quite often when I'm working."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600570,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Mm~!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600580,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I like it a lot."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600590,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Do you wanna eat it together sometime? I can cook!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600600,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "I'm actually pretty good at it!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600610,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Oh!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600620,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei! I forgot!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600630,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "The ramen cookware."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600640,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "You can pick it up later."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600650,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I've got everything here, so don't worry."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600660,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600670,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I knew I could count on you!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600680,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600690,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'll pick it up next time!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600700,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "And I'll make you ramen again!"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTH": [
    {
      "Id": 100600010,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600020,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คุณครู!!!!!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600030,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "เมกุ? มีอะไรเหรอ?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600040,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ใส่เครื่องหมายมาขนาดนี้\nเหมือนมีเรื่องด่วนอะไรเลย"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600050,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อื้อ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600060,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ตอนนี้"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600070,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "เกิดเรื่องใหญ่มากๆ ใหญ่สุดๆ เลย"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600080,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อยากให้ครูช่วยหน่อย"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600090,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "ช่วยหน่อยนะ-!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600100,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คุณครู!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600110,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ยังไงวันนี้ก็ขอบคุณมากนะ!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600120,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คราวหน้าซื้อมากินด้วยกันเยอะๆ\nเลยนะ เข้าใจมั้ย?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "สัญญา!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600140,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อึกกก..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600150,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ทรมาน"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600160,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คุณครู... ทรมานจัง"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600170,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "...!? เมกุ!?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600180,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "เกิดอะไรขึ้นเหรอ!?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อื้อ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ความฉลาด..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ฉันต้องการความฉลาดของคุณครู..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600220,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "ช่วยด้วย คุณครู~!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คุณครู"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "โมโหแล้วนะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600250,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ก็ดูเหมือนจะโมโหจริงๆ นั่นแหละ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600260,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "พอดีครูโฟกัสงานมากเกินไปน่ะ..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600270,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อื้อๆ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600280,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "แต่ก็ไม่เป็นไร! มันสนุกดีนะ!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600290,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "เอาไว้มาสอนฉันใหม่หน่อยนะ คุณครู!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600300,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ไว้เจอกันนะ~~!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600310,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คุณครู!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600320,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คุณครู ได้ข่าวมาแล้วละ!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600330,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "น้ำร้อนไม่ไหลเหรอ?\nตอนนี้อาบน้ำเย็นอยู่เหรอ?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600340,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ฮือ... จะตายแล้ว จริงๆ นะ~"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600350,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ก็... ไม่มีปัญหาอะไรนี่"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600360,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "!!!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600370,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ไม่ได้นะคุณครู!! เรื่องน้ำร้อนนี่เรื่อง\nใหญ่มากนะ!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600380,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อากาศหนาวจะตาย อาบน้ำเย็นได้ไง!\nเดี๋ยวก็ป่วยหรอก!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600390,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "แล้วทำไมจู่ๆ ถึงมาเป็นห่วงเนี่ย...?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600400,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "อดทนเดี๋ยวมันก็ผ่านไป..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600410,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อื้ม!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600420,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ช่วยไม่ได้นะ... ฉันคงต้องออกโรงเอง\nซะแล้ว!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600430,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "...???"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600440,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "...เมกุ??"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600450,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อา~ สนุกจังเลย!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600460,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "โมริโมริคุงอร่อยมากเลย ขอบคุณนะคะ!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600470,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ครูต่างหากที่ต้องขอบคุณน่ะ เมกุ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600480,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ถ้าจำเป็นเมื่อไรก็บอกได้ตลอดเลยนะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600490,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600500,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คราวหน้าไปแช่ออนเซ็นด้วยกันนะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600510,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ฮิฮิฮิ...!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600520,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คุณครู"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600530,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ชอบกินราเม็งมั้ย?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600540,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "แบบพวกราเม็งถ้วยอะไรพวกนี้"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600550,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ชอบสิ ทำไมเหรอ?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600560,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "พอทำงานแล้วก็ได้กินบ่อยๆ น่ะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600570,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อื้ม~!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600580,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ฉันชอบมากเลยนะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600590,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ถ้าคุณครูสะดวกเมื่อไร มากินราเม็ง\nด้วยกันมั้ย? ฉันจะต้มให้เอง!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600600,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "ฉันมั่นใจว่าทำได้อร่อยมากด้วย!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600610,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อ๊ะ!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600620,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คุณครู!! เกือบลืมไปเลย"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600630,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "พวกอุปกรณ์ครัวที่ใช้ต้มราเม็ง..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600640,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "เตรียมไว้ให้แล้ว ไว้แวะมาเอาไปด้วยล่ะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600650,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "เตรียมไว้ให้แล้ว ไม่ต้องห่วง..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600660,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600670,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ว่าแล้วเชียว สมกับเป็นคุณครูจริงๆ!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600680,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ขอบคุณนะ!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600690,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ไว้ฉันจะแวะไปเอานะ!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100600700,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "แล้วจะไปต้มราเม็งให้อีก!!"
    }
  ],
